      "en": "about whom, when I was at Jerusalem, the chief priests and the elders of the Jews informed me, asking for a sentence against him.",
      "ko": "내가 예루살렘에 있을 때에 유대인의 대제사장들과 장로들이 그를 고소하여 정죄하기를 청하기에",
      "source_text_hash": "5432c4b0a7e32b862344b0eb54ed68a2565c412716019fa143d1764cc7c12d9f",
      "translation_text_hash": "cfb0f995070ddcabad8d86f405175ab06f3c25e7442aab3708fe2ba3cc0dd8b9",
